flowchart TD
    accTitle: Renderer boundary crossings
    accDescr: Solid arrows indicate a dependency or call into another subsystem. Relationships are source-backed examples, not an exhaustive transitive graph.
    Scene[Scene resources and nodes] --> Server[RenderingServer and retained state]
    Editor[Editor previews import and shader tools] --> Server
    Tools[Lightmapper and GPU compression] --> RD[RenderingDevice]
    Loader[Core ResourceLoader] -->|progress sync| Server
    Engine[Core Engine frame limit] --> RD
    Server --> Core[Core objects math queues and threads]
    Renderer[Renderer implementations] --> RD
    Renderer --> XR[XR and camera services]
    Shader[Shader language and preprocessor] --> Includes[Scene ShaderInclude resource]
    RD --> Compiler[glslang module]
    Platform[DisplayServer implementations] --> Context[Graphics context and device drivers]
    Renderer -->|MetalFX native integration| Metal[Concrete Metal driver]
    Vulkan[Vulkan driver] -->|conditional glue| Android[Android platform services]
